nts and results snapshots for final) the claim is conditional: (i) the minimal investment found by the evaluator-owned reference solver is expected to vary with the aggregation rule (hypothesis, to be supported, refuted or qualified by the paired per-case reference costs, including infeasible cases) and with how correlated task scores are, tested against a within-task shuffled-score null; (ii) a candidate planner is credited only for plans that the trusted verifier confirms, scored relative to the reference solver, and is claimed better than the evaluator-owned naive baselines only if its paired final-plane main efficiency is strictly higher. No claim is made about real training effects, other leaderboards, other fields sizes, spillover or heterogeneous task costs; sensitivity to K, cap policy and field is reported as a limitation or an explicit robustness check, not assumed.\"\n },\n \"candidate\": {\n  \"interface\": \"python_rpc_v1:handle\",\n  \"editable_paths\": [\n   \"program_0/src\"\n  ]\n },\n \"evaluators\": {\n  \"search\": \"evaluate.py\",\n  \"final\": \"evaluate_final.py\"\n },\n \"resources\": {\n  \"search_root\": \"resources/search\",\n  \"final_root\": \"resources/final\",\n  \"public_artifact_bundle\": null\n },\n \"data\": {\n  \"search_roles\": [\n   \"search_helm_mmlu\"\n  ],\n  \"final_roles\": [\n   \"final_olb_boards\"\n  ]\n },\n \"metrics\": {\n  \"search\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"combined_score\",\n    \"data_role\": \"search_helm_mmlu\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"main_efficiency\",\n    \"data_role\": \"search_helm_mmlu\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"control_efficiency\",\n    \"data_role\": \"search_helm_mmlu\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"plan_validity_rate\",\n    \"data_role\": \"search_helm_mmlu\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"final\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"combined_score\",\n    \"data_role\": \"final_olb_boards\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"main_efficiency\",\n    \"data_role\": \"final_olb_boards\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"co